Subject: [PATCH] 09770: fix(analysis): preserve conflicting return
 continuation evidence

Evaluate suspicious call sites together per target and retain decoded straight-line return continuations as contrary evidence before inferring no-return. Preserve the existing threshold, fall-through callfixup guard, and known no-return callers.
---
